This repository contains no model weights and does not download anything at run time. At run time it
imports an unmodified checkout of zhangrongxiang/LeapTalk (Apache License 2.0) that the administrator
installs separately, and loads weights the administrator downloads (see docs/LICENSING.md):
Soul-AILab/SoulX-FlashHead-1_3B (Apache License 2.0), z-rx/leaptalk (Apache License 2.0; its
taew2_1.pth is byte-identical to madebyollin/taehv taew2_1.pth, MIT License) and
facebook/wav2vec2-base-960h (Apache License 2.0).

runtime/leaptalk_job.py re-implements the chunk loop of LeapTalk's inference.py (stream mode),
Copyright the LeapTalk authors, Apache License 2.0, calling the upstream helper functions unchanged;
the differences are listed at the top of that file.

The process-control, configuration and test code is adapted from ComfyUI-MonarchRT and
ComfyUI-CausalForcing (https://github.com/hiroki-abe-58), Copyright 2026 hiroki-abe-58,
Apache License 2.0.
